    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Utopia City is an action-packed first person shooter set in the virtual world of Utopia.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are responsible for the salvation of humankind - destroy Utopia City or suffer indefinite virtual slavery. Fight for the future of the real world as you become involved in massive combat scenes against a host of powerful opponents. You are the last hope for the survival of your race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Absorbing story line</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 High energy, blasting gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Outstanding sound effects and musical score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 An arsenal of futuristic weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dozens of unique characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Real time physics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you a real hero?</strong></p>",
